  "description": "Comfortable accommodation for 12 + 2 guests in 6 guest cabins. There is 1 master cabin, 3 double cabins and 2 double cabins with addditional bed; providing more than enough space to comfortably enjoy perfect cruise in Croatia!\n\nAll of the cabins are air-conditioned and equipped to the highest standard. The usage of air conditioning is 12 hours per day. The saloon is spacious and comfortable providing inside dining area with yacht bar.\n\n1 x MASTER CABIN: Cabin with king size bed (180 x 200 cm). Cabin size is 18 m2. Ensuite bathroom with home type toilet and shower box.\n3 x DOUBLE CABIN: Cabin with double bed (180 x 200 cm). Cabin size is 10 m2. Ensuite bathroom with home type toilet and shower box.\n2 x DOUBLE CABIN + SINGLE BED: Cabin with double bed (180 x 200 cm) and single bed. Cabin size is 10 m2. Ensuite bathroom with home type toilet and shower box.\n\nBase / Home Port: Split / Dubrovnik, Croatia\nOperating Area: Croatia\n\nEMBARKATION AND DISEMBARKATION DAY:\nSATURDAY",
